        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "7fa8c476-6ae3-3a70-ba06-7f3522ee2dbf",
                "word": "polyphobie",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "0413b925-00a7-45d6-92dc-7cf783ab3143",
                        "entry_id": "7fa8c476-6ae3-3a70-ba06-7f3522ee2dbf",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "polyphobies"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "faf3807b-b8de-3d20-934e-7a4a013f2606",
                        "entry_id": "7fa8c476-6ae3-3a70-ba06-7f3522ee2dbf",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Peur de plusieurs choses."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ad2082d5-f61b-4b07-926c-8902a52fb066",
                                "sense_id": "faf3807b-b8de-3d20-934e-7a4a013f2606",
                                "text": "Pour moi, de tels outrages ne pouvaient provenir que de la polyphobie des extrémistes nationalistes chrétiens, qui voient dans les nouvelles lois d’émancipation sociale une menace pour le christianisme."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "eafcfbf2-5561-3f14-b971-5104d80d43dd",
                        "entry_id": "7fa8c476-6ae3-3a70-ba06-7f3522ee2dbf",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Discrimination, aversion pour le polyamour ; attitude hostile envers les polyamoureux."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "64dd7613-8504-4a3f-869b-582a5b91a4fa",
                                "sense_id": "eafcfbf2-5561-3f14-b971-5104d80d43dd",
                                "text": "À cet égard, bien que l'homosexualité soit mieux acceptée dans certains grands centres urbains, plusieurs individus sont encore « homophobes » (Joane (E2)), il doit donc en être sensiblement de même en ce qui concerne la \"polyphobie\". Cette peur du polyamour alimentée par les préjugés des non-polys (et même de certains polys : l'hostilité horizontale, révélatrice de son illégitimité (chapitre 1.4), aurait des impacts très concrets dans la vie de nos répondant-es, notamment sur le plan familial ou au travail, comme le souligne Deri (2015): « There are real consequences that corne from being labelled a sexual deviant, including exlcusion from family, loss of employment, and having children apprehended » (p. 112)."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a5c34645-257d-45c0-ba59-415323f76dfa",
                        "source_entry_id": "7fa8c476-6ae3-3a70-ba06-7f3522ee2dbf",
                        "target_lang_word": "polyphobia",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "polyphobia",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7720243e-2abc-347f-9b57-0ecbaffb70e0",
                                        "entry_id": "ec989c23-09f0-3e49-a3e7-71ff40187a82",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Fear of many things; a collection of fears."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6c2d6b8e-1ce0-465f-844e-365a84a64562",
                                                "sense_id": "7720243e-2abc-347f-9b57-0ecbaffb70e0",
                                                "text": "Obviously it was related to the entire gestalt of Simon's polyphobia and compensatory counterphobia. The boys used to watch horror movies on late-night television […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3deb8476-2dcf-45d6-8a87-003579e243f0",
                                                "sense_id": "7720243e-2abc-347f-9b57-0ecbaffb70e0",
                                                "text": "Some people suffer from polyphobia, which is the fear of many things. Phobias are real and can be beneficial to keep us safe, that is, if we don't allow them to paralyze us and prevent us from enjoying life."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "57d6d760-04b3-3081-b78e-99fe9623551d",
                                        "entry_id": "ec989c23-09f0-3e49-a3e7-71ff40187a82",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Fear, hatred, or dislike of, or prejudice against, polyamory or polyamorous people."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c4e9b3b3-77ed-4460-8fb7-493ce2f9f728",
                                                "sense_id": "57d6d760-04b3-3081-b78e-99fe9623551d",
                                                "text": "Just how bad a problem is polyphobia? I'm not willing to live anyplace where I have to be closeted […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d4f7fff7-1fbc-4108-83f2-a48624cf0d34",
                                                "sense_id": "57d6d760-04b3-3081-b78e-99fe9623551d",
                                                "text": "Ren noted the following internalization of polyphobia: My date had dated other people, but it's a lot different if it's a family unit living together […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3ff09965-5511-4f6c-ad4e-15b29be9f6da",
                                                "sense_id": "57d6d760-04b3-3081-b78e-99fe9623551d",
                                                "text": "Monopride usually comes together with polyphobia, which has been defined as (conscious or unconscious) fear of or disgust toward nonmonogamy […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
